# The container root filesystem is built by ../fetch-rootfs.sh and is NOT
# committed to git (see .gitignore). This file just keeps the directory present
# in the source tree so the bundle layout is visible.
#
# To populate it:
#     ./bundles/busybox/fetch-rootfs.sh
#
# That produces bin/sh (busybox, or a static smoke-test payload) plus the
# skeleton dirs the runtime mounts (proc, sys, dev, ...).
